(7736405, 1275471, 141319, '<td valign="top">I like the post you did on this - very pretty</td>', 'I like the post you did on this - very pretty', '2023-01-11 01:47:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7736406, 1275499, 141319, '<td valign="top">You did magic with the light here - "real" or in post, doesn''t matter :-)</td>', 'You did magic with the light here - "real" or in post, doesn''t matter :-)', '2023-01-11 01:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7736407, 1275493, 141319, '<td valign="top">Very cool perspective</td>', 'Very cool perspective', '2023-01-11 01:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7736408, 1275418, 141319, '<td valign="top">What a cool place!! and what a shame it has been neglected like this.</td>', 'What a cool place!! and what a shame it has been neglected like this.', '2023-01-11 02:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7736409, 1275381, 114285, '<td valign="top">It looks like your cut out the background, not sure youve done it before, I know its very tricky. Drives me nuts sometimes. Did you think about just blurring it out instead? <br/> <br/>I love overgrown buildings, maybe if you shot this towards sunrise or sunset it might have appealed to me more.</td>', 'It looks like your cut out the background, not sure youve done it before, I know its very tricky. Drives me nuts sometimes. Did you think about just blurring it out instead?  I love overgrown buildings, maybe if you shot this towards sunrise or sunset it might have appealed to me more.', '2023-01-11 02:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7736412, 1275476, 29535, '<td valign="top">Cool colours! Love the lighting bursting in too and the amount of detail of the exposed walls.</td>', 'Cool colours! Love the lighting bursting in too and the amount of detail of the exposed walls.', '2023-01-11 06:22:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7736413, 1275407, 29535, '<td valign="top">The bed adds a lot to this photo. Great details on the walls too and a perfect time to shoot.</td>', 'The bed adds a lot to this photo. Great details on the walls too and a perfect time to shoot.', '2023-01-11 06:22:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7736414, 1275304, 29535, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t seem like the US, very interesting building!</td>', 'This doesn''t seem like the US, very interesting building!', '2023-01-11 06:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7736415, 1275368, 29535, '<td valign="top">It''s a very cool subject and location. I''m not such a fan of the edit here, but it''s a great dynamic image.</td>', 'It''s a very cool subject and location. I''m not such a fan of the edit here, but it''s a great dynamic image.', '2023-01-11 06:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7736417, 1275486, 29535, '<td valign="top">Very nice! It''s surprising how many old buildings like this end up devoured by single large trees. Wonderful juxtaposition.</td>', 'Very nice! It''s surprising how many old buildings like this end up devoured by single large trees. Wonderful juxtaposition.', '2023-01-11 06:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7736418, 1275405, 29535, '<td valign="top">Great compositional choice! What a great old building and such a shame... Wonder what will happen to it?</td>', 'Great compositional choice! What a great old building and such a shame... Wonder what will happen to it?', '2023-01-11 06:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7736419, 1275488, 29535, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, great colours and subject.</td>', 'Nice shot, great colours and subject.', '2023-01-11 06:27:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7736420, 1275443, 29535, '<td valign="top">Looks like a treasure trove of a location! Great choice with the outhouse. The image really speaks for itself.</td>', 'Looks like a treasure trove of a location! Great choice with the outhouse. The image really speaks for itself.', '2023-01-11 06:28:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7736421, 1275470, 29535, '<td valign="top">I think it''ll take more than a new fuse to fix up this place ;) good find, love how the plants are starting to grow in the concrete wherever they can squeeze in.</td>', 'I think it''ll take more than a new fuse to fix up this place ;) good find, love how the plants are starting to grow in the concrete wherever they can squeeze in.', '2023-01-11 06:29:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7736422, 1275259, 29535, '<td valign="top">Italy is a treasure trove of these kind of places. Lovely ivy growing on the side and the lighting is great and dynamic. I''d hazard a guess that it''s in Tuscany :)</td>', 'Italy is a treasure trove of these kind of places. Lovely ivy growing on the side and the lighting is great and dynamic. I''d hazard a guess that it''s in Tuscany :)', '2023-01-11 06:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7736423, 1275307, 29535, '<td valign="top">Bonus points for being a unique image in this challenge. Great addition with the walker too! Good find.</td>', 'Bonus points for being a unique image in this challenge. Great addition with the walker too! Good find.', '2023-01-11 06:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7736424, 1275477, 29535, '<td valign="top">This is what I expected in this challenge - dynamic lighting bursting in through lone, broken windows, graffiti, dusty old concrete and a sense of adventure. Good job!</td>', 'This is what I expected in this challenge - dynamic lighting bursting in through lone, broken windows, graffiti, dusty old concrete and a sense of adventure. Good job!', '2023-01-11 06:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7736425, 1275495, 29535, '<td valign="top">Best I''ve seen so far. Perfect blend of location and timing the light wonderfully. Great job!</td>', 'Best I''ve seen so far. Perfect blend of location and timing the light wonderfully. Great job!', '2023-01-11 06:32:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7736426, 1275418, 29535, '<td valign="top">Most unique subject of the challenge I''ll give you that! Great capture in a difficult location/conditions. Nice composition and obviously, a really curious location that I hope you share the story of in the description :)</td>', 'Most unique subject of the challenge I''ll give you that! Great capture in a difficult location/conditions. Nice composition and obviously, a really curious location that I hope you share the story of in the description :)', '2023-01-11 06:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7736427, 1275404, 29535, '<td valign="top">Unique angle on the challenge. I like it!</td>', 'Unique angle on the challenge. I like it!', '2023-01-11 06:35:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7736429, 1275494, 29535, '<td valign="top">The dude in his pants makes it. Love the colours here and the sense of rough, buzzing chaos that is so wonderful about these kinds of cities. Great composition too having that movement from the bikers without letting them block or dominate the shot. My only slight issue is the number of people present suggests the opposite of abandoned, but honestly I don''t care that much as it''s clear that a large part of the subject is uninhabited.</td>', 'The dude in his pants makes it. Love the colours here and the sense of rough, buzzing chaos that is so wonderful about these kinds of cities. Great composition too having that movement from the bikers without letting them block or dominate the shot. My only slight issue is the number of people present suggests the opposite of abandoned, but honestly I don''t care that much as it''s clear that a large part of the subject is uninhabited.', '2023-01-11 06:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7736430, 1275493, 29535, '<td valign="top">One of my biggest struggles in this contest was finding interesting angles. This is a great example of how to do it. Thank you and great job!</td>', 'One of my biggest struggles in this contest was finding interesting angles. This is a great example of how to do it. Thank you and great job!', '2023-01-11 06:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7736478, 1275381, 83313, '<td valign="top">Trying to improve with leaving feedback on my low votes. A lot of great potential in this, but it is not coming off to me well, I''m afraid. It seems cropped in a little too tight with a lack of detail and some haloing (at the border of the leaves and sky) from increased contrast. Would love to see a re-edit of this.</td>', 'Trying to improve with leaving feedback on my low votes. A lot of great potential in this, but it is not coming off to me well, I''m afraid. It seems cropped in a little too tight with a lack of detail and some haloing (at the border of the leaves and sky) from increased contrast. Would love to see a re-edit of this.', '2023-01-12 14:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7736480, 1275405, 83313, '<td valign="top">A good effort to create an interesting composition, but it seems rather flat to me and a plain grey sky with no interest in it doesn''t have anything to add. Sorry, but a solid 5.</td>', 'A good effort to create an interesting composition, but it seems rather flat to me and a plain grey sky with no interest in it doesn''t have anything to add. Sorry, but a solid 5.', '2023-01-12 14:18:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7736481, 1275471, 83313, '<td valign="top">I see some unpleasant haloing around the edge of the roof and sky. That is often hard to see when editing and I''ve done it as well. The processing of the sky may also be a little too heavy relative to the appearance of the buildings.</td>', 'I see some unpleasant haloing around the edge of the roof and sky. That is often hard to see when editing and I''ve done it as well. The processing of the sky may also be a little too heavy relative to the appearance of the buildings.', '2023-01-12 14:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7736482, 1275418, 83313, '<td valign="top">We have one of these on the other side of Dallas. I''ve driven past it once. These look to be in better shape. I wonder if there are any that have been maintained or restored?</td>', 'We have one of these on the other side of Dallas. I''ve driven past it once. These look to be in better shape. I wonder if there are any that have been maintained or restored?', '2023-01-12 14:23:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7736485, 1275259, 83313, '<td valign="top">An interesting old building. The midday sun hurts this for me a little, though. I wonder if it might do well in a B/W? That could bring out that diagonal stripe of the shadow on the wall as a major element.</td>', 'An interesting old building. The midday sun hurts this for me a little, though. I wonder if it might do well in a B/W? That could bring out that diagonal stripe of the shadow on the wall as a major element.', '2023-01-12 14:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7736486, 1275487, 83313, '<td valign="top">An interesting scene of this old shed. Not much in the way of any details showing in that snow covered roof, though. My eye keeps locking onto it, scanning for some more texture and not finding any.</td>', 'An interesting scene of this old shed. Not much in the way of any details showing in that snow covered roof, though. My eye keeps locking onto it, scanning for some more texture and not finding any.', '2023-01-12 14:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7736487, 1275404, 83313, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of the broken window to frame the rest of the building.</td>', 'Very nice use of the broken window to frame the rest of the building.', '2023-01-12 14:37:49.000000', NULL, 1),
