(7736767, 1275461, 63398, '<td valign="top">I get the dress/chair thing and it''s a good image. 7 for that. I would love to see what that exact same image, angle &amp; perspective without the chair would look like. Great find!</td>', 'I get the dress/chair thing and it''s a good image. 7 for that. I would love to see what that exact same image, angle & perspective without the chair would look like. Great find!', '2023-01-17 12:32:03.000000', NULL, 1),
