(7736769, 1275304, 63398, '<td valign="top">I love how the level of light in the foreground makes me want more yet works to retain a haunted aspect that makes one seek the delineation between the stones. The sun as contrast draws on that particularly well. Nice shot. 8</td>', 'I love how the level of light in the foreground makes me want more yet works to retain a haunted aspect that makes one seek the delineation between the stones. The sun as contrast draws on that particularly well. Nice shot. 8', '2023-01-17 12:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
