(7736889, 1275368, 18505, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love the subject and the editing.  The colors are amazing and the softness of the trees evokes the memories wrapping around the structure of the mill.  I marvel how it has become part of the rocky outcrop as it has weathered the years.  I can imagine it nearly buried in snow through the winters and surviving avalanches and wind storms.  I have more trouble trying to imagine where exactly YOU were when taking this image.  I''m sure there is a good story to go with this.  One of my favorites in the challenge and I gave you a 9.  I think this was sadly underscored.</td>', 'I absolutely love the subject and the editing.  The colors are amazing and the softness of the trees evokes the memories wrapping around the structure of the mill.  I marvel how it has become part of the rocky outcrop as it has weathered the years.  I can imagine it nearly buried in snow through the winters and surviving avalanches and wind storms.  I have more trouble trying to imagine where exactly YOU were when taking this image.  I''m sure there is a good story to go with this.  One of my favorites in the challenge and I gave you a 9.  I think this was sadly underscored.', '2023-01-18 17:24:05.000000', NULL, 0),
